*
* This macro creates a batch file to restore 'long' file name been
* corrupted by LHA DOS compress utility
macro restore
mess Attention !!! This list of the corrupted file names is done 'by hand'
mess -------------  check it each time one changes the list of the files
mess                with  "dir /x" command
Application data bin/restore.bat

rem *-- Author :    Valery Fine (Fine@vxcern.cern.ch)   04/24/96
rem ==================================================

Echo Restore name of the AA_README file
cd root
ren AA_REA~1 AA_README

Echo Restore the name of Tutorial directory
ren TUTORI~1 tutorials

Echo restore the 'long' names of the "Tutorials' macros
cd tutorials
ren ROOTRC~1        .rootrc
ren BENCHM~1.C      benchmarks.C
ren DEMOSH~1.C      demoshelp.C
ren EDITOR~1.C      EditorBar.C
ren FILLRA~1.C      fillrandom.C
ren FRAMEW~1.C      framework.C
ren NA49GE~1.C      na49geomfile.C
ren NA49VI~1.C      na49visible.C
ren ROOTAL~1.C      rootalias.C
ren ROOTLO~1.C      rootlogoff.C
ren ROOTLO~2.C      rootlogon.C
ren ROOTMA~1.C      rootmarks.C
cd ..

Echo restore the 'long' names of the ROOT DLLs
cd bin
ren  ROOT_B~1.DLL    Root_Base.dll
ren  ROOT_C~1.DLL    Root_Cint.dll
ren  ROOT_C~2.DLL    Root_Clib.dll
ren  ROOT_C~3.DLL    Root_Cont.dll
ren  ROOT_F~1.DLL    Root_Func.dll
ren  ROOT_G~2.DLL    Root_Gpad.dll
ren  ROOT_G~1.DLL    Root_Graf.dll
ren  ROOT_G~3.DLL    Root_Graf3d.dll
ren  ROOT_H~1.DLL    Root_Hist.dll
ren  ROOT_H~2.DLL    Root_Html.dll
ren  ROOT_M~1.DLL    Root_Matrix.dll
ren  ROOT_M~2.DLL    Root_Meta.dll
ren  ROOT_M~3.DLL    Root_Minuit.dll
ren  ROOT_P~1.DLL    Root_Postscript.dll
ren  ROOT_P~2.DLL    Root_Proof.dll
ren  ROOT_R~1.DLL    Root_Rint.dll
ren  ROOT_T~1.DLL    Root_Tree.dll
ren  ROOT_W~1.DLL    Root_Win32.dll
ren  ROOT_W~2.DLL    Root_WinNT.dll
cd ..

Echo restore the 'long' names of the C++ interpreter system includes
cd cint
cd include
ren ARRAYI~1.H      arrayiostream.h
ren CONSTA~1.H      constants.h
ren EXCEPT~1.H      exception.h
ren STATIS~1.H      statistics.h
ren STREAM~1.H      streambuf.h
ren STRIOS~1.H      striostream.h
ren STRSTR~1.H      strstream.h
ren XYGRAP~1.H      xygraphbuf.h
cd ..
cd ..

bin/restore.bat

return
